  "name": "body-rules",
  "body": "Every template has an implied `body` field: required / optional / disallowed, with limits max_words, max_paragraphs, max_list_items, subheadings allowed?. Body only comes from Markdown after the frontmatter; a `body:` key in YAML = error with guidance. Section templates used as field types take YAML data only.",
